                                "sense_id": "18ce7e55-fb7f-3119-8940-06daf0fcd551",
                                "text": "One might have wove Stuffs with it, had it been prepar'd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c026a5de-62dc-4402-9b7a-681aba9b9239",
                                "sense_id": "18ce7e55-fb7f-3119-8940-06daf0fcd551",
                                "text": "[…]and the pearls which they have wove among her black tresses, were whiter than the frozen hail drops."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b361ac46-76be-4dce-b0c4-ca62b92bcf07",
                                "sense_id": "18ce7e55-fb7f-3119-8940-06daf0fcd551",
                                "text": "[…]enlisting as soldiers, during the late war, who, had they stuck to their looms, would have wove, at least, 50 pounds worth of cloth each in the year"
